{
"dur": 56.028,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 7.277,
"text": "In 1988, Fink and a small group of partners set up a new firm inside the offices of the private equity company Blackstone.",
"end": 7.552
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 7.552,
"vo_start": 7.827,
"vo_end": 13.841,
"text": "It was called Blackstone Financial Management. A few years later it took a new name: BlackRock.",
"end": 14.116
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 14.116,
"vo_start": 14.391,
"vo_end": 20.148,
"text": "The pitch to clients was about protection more than prediction: we will show you what could go wrong with your money before it happens.",
"end": 20.423
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 20.423,
"vo_start": 20.698,
"vo_end": 26.618,
"text": "To do that, they built software that ran on a single workstation at first. They called it Aladdin.",
"end": 26.893
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 26.893,
"vo_start": 27.168,
"vo_end": 36.208,
"text": "Aladdin asks 'what if?' across every holding. What if interest rates jump? What if oil collapses? What if borrowers stop paying?",
"end": 36.483
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 36.483,
"vo_start": 36.758,
"vo_end": 42.838,
"text": "It runs thousands of scenarios and shows how each one would hit a portfolio, loan by loan and bond by bond.",
"end": 43.113
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 43.113,
"vo_start": 43.388,
"vo_end": 50.488,
"text": "Over time BlackRock began renting Aladdin to other investors: pension funds, insurers, even rival asset managers.",
"end": 50.763
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 50.763,
"vo_start": 51.038,
"vo_end": 55.078,
"text": "Today it helps watch over trillions of dollars, much of it not BlackRock's own.",
"end": 56.028
}
],
